{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azoth is a strategic deckbuilding card game where you'll harness the powers of Blood, Sol, and Anima to build synergistic card combinations through a unique linking system that rewards careful planning and strategic play. Take down increasingly challenging pattern cards and bosses in each act on your quest to reach AZOTH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/f9fbb3df73eacc027768c84362b34db7.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/f9fbb3df73eacc027768c84362b34db7.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/002f1c3769f0d1e101fbca2873e537b4.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards must be played in strategic links - sequential numbers, groups of identical numbers, or sets of the same element. Each card's valence number determines the minimum number of cards required in its link. The higher the valence, the more challenging it is to play, but the greater its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/c4b1d34de4738416790178b91048f611.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/c4b1d34de4738416790178b91048f611.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=339 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.poster.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.webm?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.mp4?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/99a8975d29debe051c8eefc6ff03d581.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build increasingly complex combos to level up your character and unlock new potential. With requirements doubling each level, you'll need to discover innovative combinations to progress through the depths of the late game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/bed307eb37e1047297ac19213ee28b84.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/bed307eb37e1047297ac19213ee28b84.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/cf4dff09deb36b671dc4c6ad86cc0012.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each act, you'll find yourself in a challenging encounter against a boss. The mechanics of each encounter is unique: Whether you're assembling cards the boss gives you into the ultimate weapon,\u00a0playing specific links to attack and block,  reclaiming cards the boss is stealing from you, or countless others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.poster.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.webm?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.mp4?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/0e1ab63cdf3a4eff9a96aacf25984506.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn you'll gain an opportunity to add cards, aspects or even select events to improve your deck and chase bigger and bigger synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/542683ff8dc1c68b0a5e073e3a103224.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/542683ff8dc1c68b0a5e073e3a103224.avif?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/cae65f9bde1759faee82290c04b2bad6.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on powerful aspects to shape the nature of each run. Manage your attunement slots and optimize each build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/b539b081961dae7fe04ee389ddd2962e.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/b539b081961dae7fe04ee389ddd2962e.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/230a8ecaeed4c851198e11ad4ac9ef0b.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome pattern cards that infiltrate your deck and disrupt your strategy. Each requires specific links to defeat, adding another layer of tactical depth. Defeated patterns grant the player drafts, which can be used to gain new cards, encounter events or take aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.poster.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.webm?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.mp4?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637620?t=1771953022","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637620?t=1771953022","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/5e9bab630d191604560180da6325a57eb8b1bbd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771953022","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/5e9bab630d191604560180da6325a57eb8b1bbd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771953022","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azoth is a strategic deckbuilding card game where you'll harness the powers of Blood, Sol, and Anima to build synergistic card combinations through a unique linking system that rewards careful planning and strategic play. Take down increasingly challenging pattern cards and bosses in each act on your quest to reach AZOTH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/f9fbb3df73eacc027768c84362b34db7.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/f9fbb3df73eacc027768c84362b34db7.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/002f1c3769f0d1e101fbca2873e537b4.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards must be played in strategic links - sequential numbers, groups of identical numbers, or sets of the same element. Each card's valence number determines the minimum number of cards required in its link. The higher the valence, the more challenging it is to play, but the greater its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/c4b1d34de4738416790178b91048f611.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/c4b1d34de4738416790178b91048f611.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=339 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.poster.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.webm?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/39ada4b9d209249ae9719fe7fe176bf1.mp4?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/99a8975d29debe051c8eefc6ff03d581.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build increasingly complex combos to level up your character and unlock new potential. With requirements doubling each level, you'll need to discover innovative combinations to progress through the depths of the late game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/bed307eb37e1047297ac19213ee28b84.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras_big/bed307eb37e1047297ac19213ee28b84.webp?t=1771953022 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/cf4dff09deb36b671dc4c6ad86cc0012.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each act, you'll find yourself in a challenging encounter against a boss. The mechanics of each encounter is unique: Whether you're assembling cards the boss gives you into the ultimate weapon,\u00a0playing specific links to attack and block,  reclaiming cards the boss is stealing from you, or countless others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.poster.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.webm?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/03cc9f5860970ba688871d08c1362da4.mp4?t=1771953022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/0e1ab63cdf3a4eff9a96aacf25984506.avif?t=1771953022\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn you'll gain an opportunity to add cards, aspects or even select events to improve your deck and chase bigger and bigger synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637620/extras/542683ff8dc1c68b0a5e073e3a103224.avif?t=1771953022\" data-big-src=h